  "description": "Run the Stratara Orleans execution model in a test's own process — one silo with in-memory reminders and grain directory, the real write stack, commit-order reader and checkpoint store on in-memory SQLite, and every period shortened to seconds. Register handlers, projections, sagas and timers with the production calls; no cluster, broker or database server. Builds on Stratara.Testing.EntityFrameworkCore.",
